37763>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
37764>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
37765>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
37766>>>>>        End
